1294051438960511", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619751_1294051442293844_8154713239817790874_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZeunRO4H31gQ7kNvwFt1V1_&_nc_oc=AdpCQZxUz6BfJX_jJ7I_n8fhi5aVM_caSdmVkeO33M5TTBJdfORSYZGMoAH91TSY40Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRUlGxEd_gq2C-2Zmu7MJO4h3Y-8XzhRFbpd_kDLZC_Q&oe=6B07172D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image Trailer.png", "id": "965261262669942", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_965261266003275_4119045274853098971_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=51Q6ooolKigQ7kNvwFUneIx&_nc_oc=Adr4TvfKwfsb2IMq4xxkPgTaxrbbafhkY5zBuVWQRR1A6aR0ahwldeiTAK9ITNBz6bU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT-4deX3V55X4kSmbdCyNAs9BCFL-IhdGNJb1_bqQXnfg&oe=6B070C45"}, "display_name": "A Trav\u00e9s del Iris", "keywords": ["Narrativa", "Exploraci\u00f3n", "Memoria", "Aventura", "Personal"], "long_description": "Revive tus recuerdos y descubre que cambi\u00f3 en ti.\n\nA trav\u00e9s del Iris es una experiencia narrativa que explora la memoria, la identidad y la introspecci\u00f3n emocional a trav\u00e9s del color, la narraci\u00f3n ambiental y la interacci\u00f3n.\n\nEn un espacio personal e \u00edntimo, los jugadores descubren fragmentos de la historia al interactuar con objetos cotidianos, sutiles pistas visuales y atm\u00f3sferas cambiantes. En lugar de basarse en una acci\u00f3n trepidante, la experiencia invita al descubrimiento pausado, la observaci\u00f3n y la interpretaci\u00f3n. El entorno evoluciona con cada interacci\u00f3n, transformando la forma en que el jugador percibe el espacio.\n\nCerrar los ojos con \"Blink-to-Think\" desencadena momentos de reflexi\u00f3n y sutiles transiciones narrativas, haciendo que la quietud forme parte de la progresi\u00f3n. \n\nUn juego de Sebastian Carrasco.", "short_description": "Una experiencia narrativa en VR donde la memoria, la identidad y el color construyen un viaje \u00edntimo de reflexi\u00f3n, interacci\u00f3n y descubrimiento emocional."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Game Icon.png", "id": "1607505360556230", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673625994_1607505367222896_1574350596834126161_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xfoIdpnBKpcQ7kNvwG8yNZq&_nc_oc=Adr1nqUHVCEQww5ud-nmrC29X-mNMotWImrPETtMugxfaMZgCnsQQAJTqbdtu_SG8Ds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGOxa5PfR5hTV3OyqyQk3iczr9rIZkqAtAHLcJ605HIw&oe=6B0721DA"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1459118102347778", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1459118105681111_1176602155369088893_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=evNuabvGrO8Q7kNvwG5-DEy&_nc_oc=AdroZsezVHChaCVyam70cFwji5snWz7Q1OhqWB8yF7UPB4bEMaCYoCPvNYT9oqPFL7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjGmgeifkfmXJsuk3yLvDkYTq9nO2Saw2AztR58K-9tw&oe=6B06FBEF"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "1327050222649759", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298137_1327050225983092_2181195551602462942_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gn3lwb4Fi-MQ7kNvwGMmvXA&_nc_oc=AdqqC5C-3XZv6HEn9GcBejvDV6RFKCaOR8Pcj8_Gbk_Kwgt4sR52CeoHl9mDZhMfm1w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7q9wDzZjtrpsOvIn-p-LcNdfwQt1ZARAWK_m98A8vbA&oe=6B070D1D"}, {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "973518925187618", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_973518928520951_3852690785809695379_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nEl6